[I] The Visualization Tool Kit

[T] An open-source, freely available software system for 3D computer
[T] graphics, image processing and visualization. VTK consists of a C++
[T] class library and several interpreted interface layers including
[T] Tcl/Tk, Java, and Python.

[U] https://www.vtk.org/

[A] Kitware, Inc
[M] Roger Mason <rmason@mun.ca>

[C] extra/scientific
[F] OBJDIR

[E] opt hdf5

[L] BSD
[V] 9.7.0
[P] X -----5---9 142.700

[CV-URL] https://vtk.org/download/
[D] 36f5704302b44d16d08bca60b470c2d35eea746ab78d86192b91afdf VTK-9.7.0.tar.gz https://www.vtk.org/files/release/9.7/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=${libdir##*/}

